OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few isolated light showers
OL,6,Fearly and in the west, but most
OL,7,Fstaying dry, with best of the
OL,8,Fafternoon highs in the east. West to
OL,9,Fsouthwest breezes.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloud thickening from the
OL,12,Fwest late evening, with an area of
OL,13,Frain spreading to all overnight, as
OL,14,Fwinds back southerly and increase
OL,15,Ffresh to strong.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
