OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FWet, windy start with the
OL,6,Fchance of some heavier outbreaks
OL,7,Fearly. Rain progressively more patchy
OL,8,Fthrough morning, leading to a dry
OL,9,Fafternoon with brighter spells
OL,10,Fbuilding from the east.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday
OL,13,Fmainly dry with light winds and sunny
OL,14,Fspells widespread in east. Monday wet,
OL,15,Foccasionally windy with the east in
OL,16,Fbest of shelter. Tuesday showery, with
OL,17,Foutbreaks focused in east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
